    "goal_index": "5",
    "text": "Does it tie? Watch a #DIV/0! typed into the IS: the count in C30 catches it and the flag turns to CHECK.",
    "teach": "",
    "why": "",
    "hint_stuck": "pulse cell C30 · Every error on the IS adds one."
